savedQuest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" savedQuest.innerHTML = quest;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>.value</code>.</p></body></html>"
